# A play session for the owner past the first boss, on R4's build
# (docs/NATIVE_R4.md): the game played onward from the first boss beaten,
# into areas no automated route reaches yet (the next regions, their
# dungeons, magic once the hero has it), with PPFX's commands bypassed and
# its output rendered natively in blocks of 5 s alternating with R3's dual
# run (DOTHEROES_PPFX_BYPASS=alt:300): the R3 blocks compare the native
# output with the existing renderer's, skipping a comparison rather than
# waiting for a readback buffer (DOTHEROES_PPFX_COMPARE_NOWAIT=1: the first
# boss session's stutter); the R4 blocks show the native output, every 30th
# handback checked.
#   SCENARIO=owner_onward_r4 build/venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/boot_smoke.py
# needs R4's development build in build/r4/play. The saves are a persistent
# root, build/play-onward/gamedata, seeded once from a copy of checkpoint
# dungeon1-boss-beaten (CONTINUE starts in the boss's room, area 38): the
# progress made in a session stays there for the next one, and each save the
# game writes is also copied to build/checkpoints/owner-onward-r4/ as a test
# checkpoint. The owner's own saves are not touched. Normal damage, sound,
# fullscreen. The comparison's results go to the run's ppfx_report.txt
# (build/sessions/boot-<time>-<tag>/; the first differing outputs in
# ppfx_dump/). If anything looks or feels wrong -- a stutter, a flicker, a
# missing effect -- press F8 (or L3+R3) right then: the mark goes into the
# run's log with its time.
#! env GAMEDATA=build/play-onward/gamedata
#! env BIN=build/r4/play/dotheroes.exe RUNS_IN=build/sessions KEEP_RUNS=1000 PREEMPT_TESTS=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NATIVE=1 DOTHEROES_PPFX_BYPASS=alt:300 DOTHEROES_PPFX_HANDBACK_CHECK=30 DOTHEROES_PPFX_COMPARE_NOWAIT=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_REPORT=ppfx_report.txt DOTHEROES_PPFX_DUMP=ppfx_dump
#! env DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env WINDOW=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_FULLSCREEN=1 AUDIO=1 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_RECORD=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env PS3RECOMP_SPIRV_CACHE=build/play-boss/cache DOTHEROES_FPS=display
#! secs 14400
until_exit build/checkpoints/owner-onward-r4
